('DRUG-004','Tapinarof','AhR agonist','Topical','Aryl hydrocarbon receptor agonism','Plaque psoriasis','Folliculitis/contact effects possible','https://www.aad.org/public/diseases/psoriasis/treatment/treatment'),
('DRUG-005','Methotrexate','Antimetabolite/systemic immunomodulator','Oral/injectable','Folate pathway and immunomodulatory effects','Moderate-severe psoriasis/PsA','Hepatic, marrow, teratogenicity; monitoring required','https://www.aad.org/member/clinical-quality/guidelines/psoriasis'),
('DRUG-006','Cyclosporine','Calcineurin inhibitor','Oral','T-cell calcineurin inhibition','Short-term rapid control in selected severe disease','Nephrotoxicity, hypertension, infection, interactions','https://www.aad.org/member/clinical-quality/guidelines/psoriasis'),
('DRUG-007','Acitretin','Systemic retinoid','Oral','Retinoid receptor modulation','Severe plaque and pustular forms','Profound teratogenicity; lipids/liver; mucocutaneous effects','https://www.aad.org/public/diseases/psoriasis/treatment/treatment'),
