('DRUG-014','Certolizumab pegol','TNF inhibitor','Biologic injection','TNF blockade','Plaque psoriasis/PsA','Serious infection and class warnings','https://www.aad.org/public/diseases/psoriasis/treatment/medications/biologics'),
('DRUG-015','Ustekinumab','IL-12/23 p40 inhibitor','Biologic injection','Blocks IL-12/23 p40','Plaque psoriasis/PsA','Infection and agent-specific warnings','https://www.aad.org/public/diseases/psoriasis/treatment/medications/biologics'),
