('DRUG-018','Brodalumab','IL-17 receptor A inhibitor','Biologic injection','Blocks IL-17RA signaling','Plaque psoriasis','Agent-specific boxed warning and infection risks','https://www.aad.org/public/diseases/psoriasis/treatment/medications/biologics'),
